# DJI SDK registration key — copy to app/dji-key.properties and fill it in.
#
# app/dji-key.properties is GITIGNORED and must stay that way. It holds the key that identifies
# this application to the DJI SDK.
#
# The key is bound to the applicationId in app/build.gradle. Do not change that id: a suffix, a
# flavour or a second variant with a different id breaks aircraft registration.
#
# gradle.properties has an AIRCRAFT_API_KEY line as a fallback. LEAVE IT EMPTY. The key lived
# there until 2026-08-16 and was committed, which is why this repository is private.
#
# Get a key at https://developer.dji.com

AIRCRAFT_API_KEY=
